  "title": "Reinsurance Burning Cost & XL Layer Pricer",
  "description": "Price an excess-of-loss (XL) reinsurance layer using the burning cost method (CAS Basics of Reinsurance Pricing). Enter historical loss experience and the layer structure; the tool trends ground-up losses to the prospective period, applies an IBNR load, computes the as-if per-occurrence (or aggregate) layer loss per year, and returns the burning cost rate, technical rate, technical premium, reinstatement cost, a year-by-year table, and a 5x5 attachment x limit sensitivity grid. Flags low credibility when fewer than 5 years or fewer than 5 non-zero layer years. Client-side. Works offline. Zero PII.",
